"story.15" = "Ancient Empires II is a turn-based strategy game. Command King Galamar and his brother Valadorn through an eight-mission campaign to defend the Kingdom of Thorin from evil.\n\nTHE STORY\nAfter the war against the dark forces, the brothers once again rule Thorin together. Three ancient Crystals, guarded by the Temples of Courage, Wisdom and Life, protect the recovering kingdom. But reports of war arrive from the north. The Crystals can protect the kingdom or unleash devastating power, and a struggle for their control begins.\n\nTHE EIGHT MISSIONS\n1. TEMPLE RAIDERS\nSkeleton raiders attack the Temple of Courage and steal its Crystal. Galamar comes to the rescue and discovers that a greater evil lies behind the raid.\n\n2. TO THE RESCUE\nValadorn reaches the Temple of Wisdom to find it under attack as well. Enemy troops escape with the Crystal of Wisdom. He must first save the temple guards, then warn Galamar that the Crystal of Life is also in danger.\n\n3. PATH OF SHADOWS\nGalamar marches through a dangerous forest at night to reach the Temple of Life. As his troops face wolves and magical creatures, the Water Elementals join his cause.\n\n4. REINFORCEMENTS\nGalamar reaches the Temple of Life ahead of the enemy. He repels the attack to protect the Crystal of Life and prepares to take it to the guarded fortresses of Thorin.\n\n5. ESCORT DUTY\nThe escort heads south along a forest road and falls into an ambush. Galamar must protect the Crystal and fight through the enemy blockade.\n\n6. NORTHBOUND\nValadorn learns that the enemy plans to intercept Galamar. He defeats the forces blocking his path and marches north to meet his brother.\n\n7. RENDEZVOUS\nGalamar's troops are ambushed again, and a dragon seizes the Crystal of Life. Valadorn arrives with reinforcements. Together, the brothers fight westward through the enemy to pursue the stolen Crystal.\n\n8. HEAVEN'S FURY\nFollowing the dragon's trail of destruction, the brothers reach the ruins of the Ancient Citadel. Saeth has gathered all three Crystals and activates the ancient power of Heaven's Fury. In the final battle, they must defeat Saeth and his minions to save the kingdom from darkness.\n\nThe following pages cover controls, hints and unit tactics. These tips also appear during the game.";
